 duration: "3 min",
 teacherNotes: "summarythis weekfocus: (1) official Sec 1 AEIS math paper format: Part 1 MCQ 34 questions 30 min + Part 2 show working 20+10–15 questions 1 hour 45 min, without calculator. (2) this weekcontent: P6 STATISTICS: DATA ANALYSIS 1.1 average as 'total value ÷ number of data', 1.2 relationship between average, total value and number of data, corresponds to preceding level rule. (3) this week High-frequency error: mean and totalvalueconfuse (average confused with total: child writestotalvalueandnotmean, or person average whenbecome total × number andnot total ÷ number), findmissingvaluetimeforget total = average × number of data (when finding a missing value, forgetting that total = average × number of data). (4) officialusewordis average (mean), notuse mean / median / mode thissomenamecall. Tell the parent: 'this weekhomeworkhas 5+8+3 questions, Simulateofficialquestionstype, not the complete 34+20+10–15 questions. childdocompleteafterabovepasstohomework app, Choosequestionselfmovegradechange, write the equationquestionsparenttake photoaccording toabovepass. '",
