 teacherNotes: "Check that Zoom settings are working. Both child and parent are on camera. Tell the parent: 'Today teaching secondary school AEIS math Week 15 week, hasmanagenumbercompare and simplify (ratios involving rational numbers, writing a ratio in its simplest form). This week is Sec 1 math paper format sample, content corresponds to the previous level Sec 1 NUMBER AND ALGEBRA, N2. Ratio and proportion: 2.1 ratios involving rational numbers, 2.2 writing a ratio in its simplest form. official MOE 2020 G3 Mathematics Syllabuses, Secondary One, NUMBER AND ALGEBRA. SEAB official rule: application Sec 2 admission, child needs to to be familiar with Sec 2 previous level (Sec 1)content. Week 8–14 week completed N1 (1.1 qualitynumberdividesolve, 1.2 HCF/LCM/flatsquarestandsquare and root, 1.3 negativenumberfourthen, 1.5 numberaxis, 1.6 notsign, 1.7 nearsimilarestimatecalculate, 1.4 skipfactor AEIS forbidusecalculatetool), this weekstart N2, only teach 2.1–2.2 (ratios involving rational numbers, writing a ratio in its simplest form). This week don't teach 2.3 questions involving ratio (compareshould use questions, thatisbelowoneweek). without calculator, need Write out reasoning steps. '",
