 teacherNotes: "givechild 5 practice questions, Have the childdo independently, Write out reasoning steps. parent can use photo with phonechild reasoning. questions 1: What does ab mean? Show your working steps. answer: ① The notation ab means a multiplied by b. ② ab = a × b. (Note: ab does NOT mean a + b.) Answer: ab means a × b. questions 2: What does a/b mean? Show your working steps. answer: ① The notation a/b means a divided by b. ② a/b = a ÷ b. Answer: a/b means a ÷ b. questions 3: What does a³ mean? Show your working steps. answer: ① The notation a³ means a cubed. ② a³ = a × a × a. (Note: a³ does NOT mean 3a or 3 × a.) Answer: a³ means a × a × a. questions 4: What does 5x mean? Show your working steps. answer: ① The notation 5x means 5 multiplied by x. ② 5x = 5 × x. (Note: 5x does NOT mean 5 + x.) Answer: 5x means 5 × x. questions 5: Wei says \&quot;3(x + y) means 3x + y\&quot;. Is Wei correct? Write what 3(x + y) means and explain why Wei's answer is wrong. Show your working steps. answer: ① Wei says 3(x + y) means 3x + y. ② Wei is NOT correct. ③ The notation 3(x + y) means 3 multiplied by the sum (x + y). ④ 3(x + y) = 3 × (x + y), not 3x + y. ⑤ If we drop the bracket and write 3x + y, that means 3 × x plus y, which is different from 3 multiplied by the whole sum (x + y). ⑥ For example, if x = 2 and y = 3, then 3(x + y) = 3 × (2 + 3) = 3 × 5 = 15, but 3x + y = 3 × 2 + 3 = 6 + 3 = 9, so they are different. Answer: Wei is NOT correct. 3(x + y) means 3 × (x + y), not 3x + y. teachteacherpatrollookchild reasoning, correct format (If the child only writes answer, does not write steps, remind 'AEIS official exam requires working working steps'). If the child writes 3 + y when 3y meaning, point out: '3y means 3 × y (multiply), not 3 + y (add).' If the child writes 2a when a² meaning, point out: 'a² means a × a (a squared), not 2a (2 times a).' If the child writes 3x + y when 3(x + y) meaning, point out: '3(x + y) means 3 × (x + y) (3 multiplied by the whole sum), not 3x + y (which is 3 times x plus y, different from 3 multiplied by the whole sum).'",
