 teacherNotes: "Open screen share or whiteboard, Write below this week's High-frequency error: 'Fossil 1: (x+3)² = x² + 9. ✗'Say clearly: 「This is High-frequency error: (a+b)² = a² + b² (dropping the middle term 2ab) (losefallmiddleitem 2ab). correctdomethod: (a+b)² = a² + 2ab + b² (hasthreeitem, nottwoitem). So (x+3)² = x² + 2(x)(3) + 3² = x² + 6x + 9. The middle term is 2ab = 2 × x × 3 = 6x. Do NOT write x² + 9 (notneedwrite x² + 9). You are missing the middle term 6x (youlosefallmiddleitem 6x). 'Have child repeat this one sentence: '(x+3)² = x² + 6x + 9. NOT x² + 9.'Again write Week two High-frequency error: 「Fossil 2: (y−5)² = y² − 25. ✗'Say clearly: 'This is High-frequency error: (a−b)² = a² − b² (dropping the middle term −2ab) (losefallmiddleitem −2ab). correctdomethod: (a−b)² = a² − 2ab + b² (hasthreeitem, middleitemisnegativesign −2ab, Finallyoneitemiscorrectsign +b²). So (y−5)² = y² − 2(y)(5) + 5² = y² − 10y + 25. The middle term is −2ab = −2 × y × 5 = −10y. Do NOT write y² − 25 (notneedwrite y² − 25). You are missing the middle term −10y (youlosefallmiddleitem −10y). 'Have child repeat this one sentence: 「(y−5)² = y² − 10y + 25. NOT y² − 25.'write Week three High-frequency error: 'Fossil 3: (x+4)² = x² − 8x + 16. ✗'Say clearly: 「This is High-frequency error: mixing the sign of 2ab (symboldomix). correctdomethod: For (a+b)², the middle term is +2ab (positive) (correctat (a+b)², middleitemiscorrectsign +2ab). So (x+4)² = x² + 2(x)(4) + 4² = x² + 8x + 16 (NOT x² − 8x + 16). If the middle term is −8x, that would be (x−4)² (Ifmiddleitemis −8x, thatis (x−4)²). 'Have the child repeats: '(x+4)² = x² + 8x + 16. (x−4)² = x² − 8x + 16.'",
