 teacherNotes: "Welcome child. 'Today is Week 64 week AEIS secondary math, we learn Sec 2 N5.14 factorisation of quadratic expressions ax²+bx+c (twotimesformulafactorformuladividesolve). This week is N5.14 only, only teachofficialfactorformuladividesolvemethod: x²+bx+c, findtwonumbermultiplyproductis c, and is b, thenwritebecome (x+first)(x+second). This istwotimesformula, has x² item. This week don't teach 5.15 multiplication and division of simple algebraic fractions (substitutenumberdivideformulamultiplication and division). this week, do not teach 5.13 grouping (Week 63 weekalready taught). this week, do not teach 5.12 identities (Week 62 weekalready taught). Week 8–56 week Ialreadycomplete Sec 1 content, Week 57 week completed Sec 2 N2.4 map scales, Week 58 week completed Sec 2 N2.5 direct and inverse proportion, Week 59 week completed Sec 2 N5.9 expansion of the product of algebraic expressions, Week 60 week completed Sec 2 N5.10 changing the subject of a formula, Week 61 week completed Sec 2 N5.11 finding the value of an unknown quantity in a given formula, Week 62 week completed Sec 2 N5.12 identities: (a+b)², (a−b)², a²−b², Week 63 week completed Sec 2 N5.13 factorisation of linear expressions ax+bx+kay+kby, this week, continue Sec 2 content (Sec 3 application preceding level). 'tellchildthis week High-frequency error focus (High-frequency error): 「this week High-frequency error focus: signs wrong (symbolerror, For example x²−5x+6 writebecome (x+2)(x+3) andnot (x−2)(x−3)); or wrong factor pair (factornumbercorrecterror, For example x²+5x+6 writebecome (x+6)(x+1) andnot (x+2)(x+3), because 6+1=7 notat 5). Icanoppositerepeatpracticethispoint, straighttochangefall. '",
