 teacherNotes: "summarythis weekfocus: (1) official Sec 2 AEIS math paper format: Part 1 MCQ 34 questions 30 min + Part 2 show working 20+10–15 questions 1 hour 45 min, without calculator. (2) this weekcontent: Sec 2 GEOMETRY AND MEASUREMENT, G2. Congruence and similarity: 2.3 properties of similar triangles and polygons (similarthreeangle and manysideshapeproperties). This week is G2.3 only. Official content: (1) corresponding angles are equal (corresponding angleare equal); (2) corresponding sides are proportional (corresponding sidebecomeratio). G2.3 onlyhastwoitemofficialproperties. Property 1: corresponding angles are equal (∠A = ∠D, ∠B = ∠E, ∠C = ∠F). Property 2: corresponding sides are proportional (AB:DE = BC:EF = AC:DF, all ratios equal). Scale factor k applies to side lengths, NOT to angles. Corresponding sides means matching sides (AB and DE, not AB and EF). Integer lengths and integer scale factors only, no calculator. (3) this week High-frequency error: corresponding sides vs non-corresponding sides offered as same ratio (wrong pair); all angles equal so sides must be equal (confuses similar with congruent); scale factor applied to an angle (angles do not scale); two options that are same correspondence in different order. (4) homework: app has 5 reading + 8 grammar + 3 writing. Reading and grammar are MCQ keyed A. Writing needs full explanation with ratio calculations and correct identification of corresponding sides and angles. Integer lengths and scale factors only. No calculator. (5) This week we teach Learntool: BoardWeike whiteboardexample questions (threeexample questions: 4-8 triangles, 50-70-60 angles, 3-9 pentagons)+ Smath Figure diagramsolve (threediagram: markcorresponding anglethreeangle, markcorresponding sidethreeangle, markcorresponding angle and corresponding siderectangleshape, helpyouremember G2.3 twoitemproperties). (6) Week 75 week, complete G2.1 congruent figures (congruent figure). Week 76 week, complete G2.2 similar figures (similar figures). this week Week 77 week, complete G2.3 properties of similar triangles and polygons (similarthreeangle and manysideshapeproperties). belowweek, continue Sec 2 content. Singapore Teaching Practice: standardprepare Preparation (BoardWeike and whiteboardexample questions + diagramsolve), model I do (teachermodel), bringpractice We do (teacherstudentoneupdo), independent You do (studentdo independently), Key questions and Af L format assessment, collectoralsummary. Readiness: comprehensioncorresponding angleare equal, corresponding sidebecomeratioconcept. Engagement: trueactualfigure (triangles, quadrilaterals, pentagons), ratiocalculate (1:2, 1:3, 1:4). Mastery: correctshoulduse G2.3 twoitemproperties, calculatemissingside length and angledegree, Explainoriginalfactor. Positive classroom culture: 'todayyou Learncansimilarthreeangle and manysideshapetwoitemofficialproperties: corresponding angleare equal, corresponding sidebecomeratio. remember: angles do not scale, corresponding sides are proportional (not necessarily equal). Keep practicing!'",
