 title: "finishreachbrotherpull Sitheorem — Pythagoras' theorem",
 mathExample: "Legs 9 cm and 12 cm → hypotenuse 15 cm. Using a² + b² = c²: 9² + 12² = 81 + 144 = 225 = 15². Legs 8 cm and 15 cm → hypotenuse 17 cm. Using a² + b² = c²: 8² + 15² = 64 + 225 = 289 = 17². Hypotenuse 26 cm, one leg 10 cm → other leg 24 cm. Using a² + b² = c²: 10² + 24² = 100 + 576 = 676 = 26².",
